  "body": "Welcome to 20 Kensington Drive, Orewa - a stunning family home that combines modern living with comfort, style and resort like amenities. Ideally located in the Kensington Park community of Orewa, just a short stroll from Orewa Beach, Orewa Village, and motorway access.\r\n\r\nThis beautifully constructed weatherboard house offers a spacious and open plan layout, with 4 bedrooms, 2 and a half bathrooms, two living areas, and a generous double garage - perfect for families seeking both space and functionality while ensuring a low maintenance lifestyle.\r\n\r\nSet on a generous 340 sqm section with a building area of 231 sqm, this property features a fully fenced yard which has been immaculately maintained and nurtured by the current owners.  Enjoy alfresco dining under the shelter of the louvred roof, or click a button to allow the sun shine through. Sit an enjoy the peaceful surrounds, the native birdlife and the mature landscaping.\r\n\r\nInside, you will find a well-designed floor plan that includes an open plan, modern kitchen that opens to a family room and separate dining and living areas. The home is adorned with quality finishes throughout and has been immaculately maintained by the current owners. The heat pump ensures year-round comfort, for heating and cooling.\r\n\r\nDon't miss out on this fantastic offering - our vendors are motivated and committed to their next move.  Call today to arrange a private viewing or visit our weekend open home.\r\n\r\nHarcourts Files: To view/download the property documents use the following link: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/ER39",
